I'm currently focused on implementing a file replacement within lines 1524-1608 to integrate a new large language model (LLM) chat routing mechanism. This involves adding a local knowledge base RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) physical matching mechanism. This will involve the system reading the `data/knowledge/` directory, and iterating through the files within to apply keyword matching. I am also adding new knowledge based components.


